---
name: bosun-start
description: Start an bosun-managed dev server. Prefer "bosun up <profile>" when starting multiple apps with dependencies.
bosun-version: {{bosun_version}}
generated-at: {{generated_at}}
---

Run: `bosun start $1`

Then block until healthy: `bosun wait $1 --until healthy --timeout 60s`.

If `wait` exits with code 2 (timeout), run `bosun errors $1 --structured` and `bosun why $1` and report both.
